<div class="rule"></div>
<p class="lead">Flight-tracked black-SUV pickups at Palm Beach's airport — curbside or at a pre-arranged meet-and-greet point inside the terminal, your chauffeur working to be ready when you land.</p>
<div style="background:rgba(212,175,55,0.1);border-left:3px solid #D4AF37;padding:16px 20px;margin-top:20px;max-width:640px">
<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#e8e8e8">Note: this airport was renamed <b>President Donald J. Trump International Airport</b> on July 9, 2026, and the passenger code officially changed from <b>PBI</b> to <b>DJT</b> on August 18, 2026. Some airlines and booking sites may still show PBI — search either code when booking.</p>
</div>
